{
 "id": "obor",
 "name": "Obor",
 "wikiUrl": "https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Obor",
 "overview": [
  "Obor has two basic attacks, being a melee attack he can use when in melee range of the player, and a ranged attack that he can use from any distance. Whether Obor will attack from ranged or path towards the player is dependent on what protection prayers the player is praying and if they are next to Obor or not.",
  "If the player is not next to Obor and is praying Protect from Missiles, he will attack with ranged and attempt to approach the player. If the player is not using Protect from Missiles, he will attack with ranged and have a 1/3 chance of approaching the player. When approaching the player, after, he will additionally attempt to step a single tile towards the player. If he is standing next to a wall, the approach mechanic does not work correctly.",
  "If the player is next to Obor and Protect from Melee is used, he has a 50% chance of attacking with melee and 50% chance of attacking with ranged. If Protect from Missiles is used, he has a 1/3 chance of attacking with ranged, and will otherwise attack with melee.",
  "Obor's melee attacks have a 25% chance to knockback the player, and if the player is knocked back, there is a 1/3 chance of being knocked down.",
  "Obor's ranged attack deals 50% less damage when Protect from Missiles is used."
 ],
